## Quick Start

* Plug in ATX connector

* Plug in power button

![enter link description here](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dekuNukem/ATX4VC/master/photos/start2.jpeg)

Push the button, PSU should turn on, powering all voltage rails. Hook it up to whatever you want!

